@startuml FraudSentry_Simplified_Overview
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam classBorderColor #343A40

title FraudSentry - Simplified System Overview

package "Frontend (React)" #F3E5F5 {
    class WebApp {
        +Login/Authentication
        +Dashboard
        +Detection Engine
        +History Viewer
    }
}

package "Backend API (FastAPI)" #E3F2FD {
    class APIServer {
        +/predict
        +/upload-batch
        +/save-report
        +/health
        +/dashboard-stats
    }
}

package "ML Engine" #FFF3E0 {
    class FraudDetector {
        +Random Forest Model
        +XGBoost Model
        +Isolation Forest
        +Ensemble Scorer
    }
    
    class AIExplainer {
        +SHAP Analysis
        +Gemini AI
    }
}

package "Data Layer" #E8F5E9 {
    class Database {
        +SQLite
        +Scan History
    }
    
    class Reports {
        +PDF Generator
    }
}

' Relationships
WebApp --> APIServer : HTTP/REST
APIServer --> FraudDetector : Predict
APIServer --> AIExplainer : Explain
APIServer --> Database : Store/Retrieve
APIServer --> Reports : Generate

note right of FraudDetector
  **3-Model Ensemble:**
  • Random Forest (Precision)
  • XGBoost (Sensitivity)
  • Isolation Forest (Anomaly)
  
  **Risk Score Fusion:**
  Weighted combination
  Threshold: 0.5
end note

note right of AIExplainer
  **Explainability:**
  • SHAP values
  • Natural language (Gemini)
  • Fraud pattern detection
end note

note bottom of APIServer
  **Model Consensus Tiers:**
  • CRITICAL: Both agree (fraud)
  • HIGH: RF only
  • MODERATE: XGB only
  • LOW: Both agree (safe)
end note

@enduml
